{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"那一刻的轻松是真的\",\"source\":\"那一刻的轻松可以是真的，并非假装\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿表达的是轻松可以是真实的，屏幕稿把可能性改成了确定事实。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"182–197小节，先前带宣告意味的波兰舞曲气息再次出现\",\"source\":\"182–197小节，也可以听成先前那些更有宣告意味、带着波兰舞曲气息的声音再次出现\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将其作为一种可选的听法，屏幕稿则把这种解释写成了确定的音乐再现。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\"source\":\"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿用条件和“仿佛”限定这是一种心理层面的听法，屏幕稿去掉限定，将其写成了确定发生的回问。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7d89faba-2db3-4126-ba4c-dfa28c88674f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T071700386028Z", "elapsed_seconds": 285.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T07:21:46.298863+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8f00439e5c7030ec240fc98b6adde0fb414fa57d6c10b369cc3b457b8bd13fd7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e4